	(descr "DEUTSCH DTM series 12-way right-angle PCB receptacle, -R005 flange mod (DTM13-12PA-R005 key A / DTM13-12PB-R005 key B - both are dimensionally IDENTICAL, only the key arrangement differs). Derived by hand from TE customer drawings DTM13-12PA-R005 rev NC and DTM13-12PB-R005 rev D. Pin grid .165 [4.19] both axes: positions +/-.083 [2.10], +/-.248 [6.29], +/-.413 [10.48] along the connector axis and +/-.0825 [2.095] across. Pin dia .041+/-.002 [1.04+/-.05]. Mounting holes .079+/-.002 [2.01+/-.05] dia, 1.350 [34.29] apart, on the pin-field centreline; boss OD .257 [6.53]. Envelope 1.500 x 1.615 [38.10 x 41.02]. Pin protrusion below seating plane .110+/-.015 [2.79+/-.38] - KEY CHARACTERISTIC, only ~1.2 mm through a 1.6 mm board. Mates DTM06-12SA (key A) / DTM06-12SB (key B). Contact rating 7.5 A.")
